   as the understanding of mirror neuron system (MNS) goes further,
   researchers. Proposed the possible correlation between autism and
   impaired MNS This current paper briefly reviewed the studies in this
   domain and illustrated major functions exerted by AMS. In addition, the
   paper presented evidences obtained from multiple sources to support the
   hypothesis that deficit in MNS is core feature of neural mechanisms of
   ASD. Finally, the issues future studies should address are discussed.},
