Abstract = {We present a neural network model that accounts for an observed
   asymmetry in the categorization of cats and dogs in 3-4 month old
   infants. The model establishes a link between infant behaviour and
   mechanisms of cortical processing. Based on developmental change in the
   cortex the model predicts behavioural change in infants between 3 and 10
   months of age.},
